{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 2, "text": "等。这就是哲学的基本问题。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 257, "w": 519, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等。这就是哲学的基本问题。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 257, "w": 519, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 3, "text": "所谓“天连地”、“天和地不会言语”等说法，在布依族古歌中是十分常见的，如《十二个", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 314, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "所谓“天连地”、“天和地不会言语”等说法，在布依族古歌中是十分常见的，如《十二个", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 314, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 4, "text": "太阳》中说：“从前那时候，天黏着大地，古老的时候，大地顶着天。”《造万物》中说：“古老那", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 378, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "太阳》中说：“从前那时候，天黏着大地，古老的时候，大地顶着天。”《造万物》中说：“古老那", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 378, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 5, "text": "些时，地像糍粑样，紧紧黏着天。天也像糍粑，紧紧黏着地。万物难生长，人们难生成。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 442, "w": 1476, "h": 63}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "些时，地像糍粑样，紧紧黏着天。天也像糍粑，紧紧黏着地。万物难生长，人们难生成。”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 442, "w": 1476, "h": 63}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 6, "text": "在《古歌》中，布依族先民并不认为天地的产生没有根据，而是明确指出天地万物，有", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 511, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在《古歌》中，布依族先民并不认为天地的产生没有根据，而是明确指出天地万物，有", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 511, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 7, "text": "其产生演化的物质性源头，这个源头就是清、浊二气。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 579, "w": 925, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "其产生演化的物质性源头，这个源头就是清、浊二气。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 579, "w": 925, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 8, "text": "如《古歌•赛胡细妹造人烟》（《得刚得王》）中说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 648, "w": 860, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "如《古歌•赛胡细妹造人烟》（《得刚得王》）中说：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 648, "w": 860, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 9, "text": "很古很古那时候，", "bbox_px": {"x": 449, "y": 708, "w": 312, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "很古很古那时候，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 449, "y": 708, "w": 312, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 10, "text": "凡尘只有浊浊气。", "bbox_px": {"x": 449, "y": 772, "w": 312, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "凡尘只有浊浊气。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 449, "y": 772, "w": 312, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 11, "text": "清气“呼呼”蒸腾腾，", "bbox_px": {"x": 450, "y": 837, "w": 358, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "清气“呼呼”蒸腾腾，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 450, "y": 837, "w": 358, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 12, "text": "浊气“扑扑”往上升。", "bbox_px": {"x": 450, "y": 900, "w": 362, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "浊气“扑扑”往上升。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 450, "y": 900, "w": 362, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 13, "text": "清气浊气相撞后，", "bbox_px": {"x": 450, "y": 974, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "清气浊气相撞后，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 450, "y": 974, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 14, "text": "交粘成个葫芦形。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 454, "y": 1034, "w": 338, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "交粘成个葫芦形。①", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 454, "y": 1034, "w": 338, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 15, "text": "很多民族的先民朴素地猜测到，宇宙的最初状态充满清、浊二气，这是宇宙演化的基", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1098, "w": 1467, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "很多民族的先民朴素地猜测到，宇宙的最初状态充满清、浊二气，这是宇宙演化的基", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1098, "w": 1467, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 16, "text": "础，即原初物。例如，彝族的《宇宙人文论》和《西南彝志》等即持此种看法。这反映出远", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1167, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "础，即原初物。例如，彝族的《宇宙人文论》和《西南彝志》等即持此种看法。这反映出远", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1167, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 17, "text": "古时代各民族思维发展的大致相近的水平，也反映出各民族哲学宇宙观受中国古代道家", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1227, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "古时代各民族思维发展的大致相近的水平，也反映出各民族哲学宇宙观受中国古代道家", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1227, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 18, "text": "哲学的影响。老子、庄子和稷下黄老学之“精气说”、“元气说”等，均认为清、浊二气是宁", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1291, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "哲学的影响。老子、庄子和稷下黄老学之“精气说”、“元气说”等，均认为清、浊二气是宁", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1291, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 19, "text": "宙的初始物质，指出气之精者变而为人之精神、灵魂，气之粗者变而为人的形体等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1356, "w": 1435, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "宙的初始物质，指出气之精者变而为人之精神、灵魂，气之粗者变而为人的形体等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1356, "w": 1435, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 20, "text": "从布依族古歌的上述记载可看出，宇宙在最初的时候并非什么也没有，而是充满了", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1420, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "从布依族古歌的上述记载可看出，宇宙在最初的时候并非什么也没有，而是充满了", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1420, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 21, "text": "清、浊二气。但这个时候，人和万物还没有产生。后来，由于清、浊二气的相互对立、运动", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1489, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "清、浊二气。但这个时候，人和万物还没有产生。后来，由于清、浊二气的相互对立、运动", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1489, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 22, "text": "和演化，才产生了万事万物，即“相撞交粘成葫芦形”。这种直观的猜想，包含了朴素辩证", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1549, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "和演化，才产生了万事万物，即“相撞交粘成葫芦形”。这种直观的猜想，包含了朴素辩证", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1549, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 23, "text": "法思想的萌芽。", "bbox_px": {"x": 128, "y": 1620, "w": 266, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "法思想的萌芽。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 128, "y": 1620, "w": 266, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 24, "text": "史诗《古歌•赛胡细妹造人烟》（《得刚得王》）接着描述了清、独二气演化产生万事", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1682, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "史诗《古歌•赛胡细妹造人烟》（《得刚得王》）接着描述了清、独二气演化产生万事", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1682, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 103, "line_no": 25, "text": "万物的过程：", "bbox_px": {"x": 124, "y": 1749, "w": 229, "h": 46}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "万物的过程：", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 124, "y": 1749, "w": 229, "h": 46}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
